      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, but the doctor's office is closed until monday and i'm in a lot of pain right now. its just a small cyst, right? it doesn't look like anything crazy. if i'm super careful with the needle and just do a tiny little prick to let the pressure out, would that be okay? i just really need the relief.",
